  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Buffalo chicken wings bake up golden and crisp, then get tossed in a tangy hot sauce and melted butter blend with a splash of citrus vinegar for extra brightness. A light cornstarch coating helps them crunch beautifully in the oven, while garlic, paprika, and a touch of honey add deep, crave worthy flavor to the sauce. Serve with celery sticks and a creamy blue cheese style dip, and watch everyone pile in. Easy, fiery, and perfect for game day, these wings disappear fast.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-buffalo-chicken-wings\">Why You’ll Love This buffalo chicken wings</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-buffalo-chicken-wings\">How to Make Buffalo Chicken Wings</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-buffalo-chicken-wings\">Pro Tips for Making buffalo chicken wings</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-buffalo-chicken-wings\">How to Serve this buffalo chicken wings</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-buffalo-chicken-wings\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This buffalo chicken wings</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Perfectly crispy texture that satisfies every crunch craving.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Spicy, tangy flavor that keeps you coming back for more.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Easy to make, so you can focus on enjoying the game.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Great for sharing, making it a hit at any gathering.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-container-11143\" class=\"wprm-recipe-container\" data-recipe-id=\"11143\" data-servings=\"4\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe wprm-recipe-template-meadow\"><d